        {"zh": "我收起翅膀，算好落点。", "en": "I fold my wings and pick my landing spot."},
        {"zh": "锁定目标，精准一击。", "en": "Target locked, precise strike."},
        {"zh": "瞄准，猎物就在。", "en": "Aim, prey there."},
        {"zh": "锁定，准备扑击。", "en": "Targeted, prepare to strike."},
        {"zh": "目标，锁定捕食。", "en": "Target, lock and hunt."},
